untability for cross-functional workstreams; leasing, financing, energy, government relations/policy, community engagement, construction, and operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Provide working leadership to the in-country cross-functional team, driving alignment and unblocking issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Represent Anthropic with government officials, utilities, energy providers, and other external stakeholders in Japan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain relationships within the Japanese government and the energy industry to support site, power, and policy outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Track progress and surface risks across parallel workstreams as the country&#39;s compute footprint scales from initial sites to multiple gigawatts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Translate between Anthropic&#39;s global compute priorities and the specific regulatory, political, and market conditions in Japan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Japanese national with established links into government and the energy industry strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Structured thinker with a track record of learning new domains quickly and going deep fast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent communicator, comfortable representing Anthropic to senior government, utility, and industry stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and coordinate cross-functional teams without direct line authority.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hyper-organized and detail-oriented, with the ability to own multiple concurrent workstreams at once.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity; a problem solver who drives structure into undefined situations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Background in energy, infrastructure, or a related 