&lt;li&gt;Represent Legal on post-closing integration, working cross-functionally to ensure smooth transitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain standardized processes, playbooks, and template documents that drive efficiency and best practices across M&amp;amp;A transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other corporate matters as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
