&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is seeking an experienced Customer Marketer to build out customer stories across the industries building with Claude. Behind every Claude deployment is a story of an organization reimagining how it works. This role tells those stories by finding the verticals where customer evidence matters most, and turning our best examples into the references and announcements that drive adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a traditional customer marketing role focused solely on case studies. You&#39;ll work closely with customers across their journey with Claude — partnering with Sales to find the customers finding value with Claude, building the relationships that turn customer champions into authentic advocates, and working with Communications to land customer milestones as high-impact announcements. Where Claude is newly landing in an industry, you&#39;ll build the bench — cultivating early wins into referenceable customers and flagship narratives that open entire verticals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll operate with autonomy and speed, building the playbooks, processes, and frameworks that let customer storytelling scale across industries — and shaping how some of the world&#39;s most recognizable companies understand, implement, and champion beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own customer storytelling for a subset of our Industries portfolio, from story identification through creation, approval, and distribution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and prioritize new verticals where customer proof points will accelerate adoption, and build the story pipeline to match&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build a bench of referenceable customers and stories in industries where Claude is newly landing, developing accounts from early wins into flagship narratives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and nurture relationships with customer executives and champions to foster authentic advocacy, guiding each story from first conversation through approval and publication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Sales and account teams to pressure-test storytelling readiness and develop account-level advocacy plans that map each priority customer to the right story, format, and moment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Communications to shape and time customer announcements, turning deployment milestones and expansions into coordinated press, content, and social moments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with our brand and creative team on customer video series, out-of-home campaigns, and other high-visibility creative moments that bring these stories to a broader audience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
