&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with third-party colocation providers or partner-operated sites, delivering IT operations outcomes inside a facility someone else runs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience standing up operations at a new site or data hall, from commissioning handoff through first deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
