&lt;p&gt;Experience with GPU/accelerator or high-density liquid-cooled infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with multi-vendor sites where facilities and IT operations are performed by different partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
