&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is rapidly scaling our compute infrastructure across a portfolio of data center builds with multiple developer partnerships. The Data Center Portfolio &amp;amp; Planning team owns the integrated view of that supply: compute allocation, decision locks, forecasting, and the frameworks that underpin all of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Data Center Portfolio Lead to manage the portfolio itself — the sites, the partners behind them, and the decisions each site has to clear on its way to operational readiness. You will be the source of truth on where every site stands, and the person who defines how each one moves from negotiation to deployment. You will build the stage gates, cadence, and tooling that establishes a true program rather than case-by-case execution. This is a highly cross-functional role, working closely with our site selection, energy, supply chain, engineering, and delivery teams, as well as external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage the portfolio overall: each site’s status, milestones, decisions taken, open items, and risks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the portfolio reviews that ground our teams on the current state of supply, decisions needed, and downstream impacts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Architect and run the stage-gate framework — the criteria, approvals, and owners at each gate — that standardizes how a site moves from negotiation through lease execution, design and chip lock, construction, and handoff to operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with the planning and design teams to decide each site’s chip allocation ahead of deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the primary point of contact between strategic partners and internal stakeholders, drive execution to critical milestones, and keep partners consistent across site selection, design, supply chain, and delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop AI-driven tooling and data pipelines that automate project updates across the portfolio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
