&lt;p&gt;Build and scale the Product Analytics Engineering team, including hiring and mentoring a team of high-performing analytics engineers embedded with Product pillars&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and execute the strategic roadmap for product data foundations and analytics capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
