&lt;li&gt;Possess hands-on experience building sophisticated financial models, conducting pricing optimization, and structuring complex deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have excellent communication and stakeholder management abilities, with proven success coordinating across multiple departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are detail-oriented with strong process improvement instincts and the ability to design scalable workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with CRM systems, CPQ tools, and contract management platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can work effectively in fast-paced, ambiguous environments while maintaining accuracy and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
