&lt;p&gt;You bring a strong background across multiple pillars of Treasury and a track record of driving complex, cross-functional initiatives through to completion with limited direction and full accountability. You are proficient in using AI tools to drive automation and process optimization, and you&#39;ll use Claude to build much of the tooling that makes Treasury faster and more precise.&lt;/p&gt;
