&lt;li&gt;Establish the operating cadence that keeps Treasury&#39;s recurring obligations on time and accurate. Keep the team in compliance by tracking completion of all debt-related, SOX, and other regular requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and automate cross-functional deliverables. Establish the content and provide the judgment behind the deliverables that give visibility into Treasury&#39;s work, such as a Treasury dashboard for the CFO and regular audit committee materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
