&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing and executing complex Treasury-related projects across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with AI tools and process automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and demonstrated ability to build internal and external relationships&lt;/li&gt;
