&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You see gaps and fill them without being asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical + human balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Equal comfort analyzing log data and conducting sensitive interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native approach:&lt;/strong&gt; You leverage LLMs to work smarter, not just harder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand AI safety stakes and insider risk&#39;s role in protecting that mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgment under uncertainty:&lt;/strong&gt; You make sound decisions with incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You distill complex findings into actionable insights for diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional navigator:&lt;/strong&gt; You build relationships and collaborate effectively across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
