&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is seeking an experienced VAT/GST professional to join our growing Tax team in our Dublin office. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for managing and advising on all indirect tax matters outside the United States, spanning Europe, UK, APAC, and other international markets. You&#39;ll work closely with our Global Indirect Tax team, compliance Lead and the broader tax team to develop and execute our international VAT/GST strategy as we scale our AI products globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity to join an AI safety company at the forefront of the industry and help build out our international indirect tax function from the ground up. You&#39;ll partner cross-functionally with Finance, Accounting, Legal, Product, and Go-to-Market teams to embed tax considerations into our global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
