&lt;li&gt;Provide VAT/GST advisory support on new product launches, pricing models, customer contracts, and go-to-market strategies across international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the indirect tax implications of corporate restructuring, entity establishment, and intercompany arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain indirect tax positions and documentation for digital services across multiple jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support tax-efficient structuring for infrastructure procurement and and reseller arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and assess the impact of regulatory changes, including EU VAT in the Digital Age, OECD initiatives, and local digital services tax developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance Support &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the Global Indirect Tax Compliance Lead to support VAT/GST registration, filing, and compliance across 30+ jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with customer classification (B2B vs B2C), and place of supply determinations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audit defence and respond to queries from international tax authorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with external advisors across jurisdictions to ensure accurate and timely compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance Systems to ensure proper tax configuration within ERP, billing platforms, and tax engines for international transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing and implementation of system changes affecting international indirect tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Jurisdictions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU (with particular focus on Ireland as primary billing entity), UK, Switzerland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Australia, Japan, Singapore, and broader APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Canada, Latin America and emerging markets as Anthropic expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
