&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced IP Counsel to help protect some of the world&#39;s fastest-growing technology brands. In this role, you will share ownership of Anthropic&#39;s global trademarks and domains practice, spanning clearance, prosecution, portfolio management, and enforcement, partnering closely with other members of our IP team, outside counsel, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic&#39;s brands are among its most valuable assets, and you will help protect them at the pace the AI industry moves. Our trademark practice spans a rapidly growing global portfolio, a high-volume enforcement program, and naming decisions for some of the most visible products in technology. This is a hands-on role for an attorney with deep trademark expertise who wants their work to matter and who is aligned with Anthropic&#39;s mission of responsible AI development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run trademark clearance for new model, product, and feature names, delivering clear, risk-rated recommendations that let teams move quickly and confidently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage global trademark prosecution and portfolio strategy in coordination with outside counsel, including filing strategy, office actions, and portfolio maintenance across many jurisdictions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead trademark and domain enforcement end to end: assess potential infringements, select the right enforcement mechanism, work with outside counsel as necessary, and drive matters to resolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help oversee our online brand protection program, working with our external vendor and IP Legal Specialist to action infringements and impersonations at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage domain portfolio strategy, including acquisitions, disputes, and recovery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respond to inbound trademark demands and support trademark-related litigation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
