&lt;p&gt;Counsel marketing, product, and go-to-market teams on brand usage and naming, translating IP risk into practical guidance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the playbooks and processes that let a lean team run a world-class global brand protection practice&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
