&lt;p&gt;Have substantial trademark and domain practice experience spanning clearance, prosecution, portfolio management, and enforcement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have current, hands-on experience: running clearances, shape filing strategies, and make enforcement calls yourself&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have managed global trademark and domain portfolios, including UDRP proceedings and online enforcement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exercise sound judgment about which matters to pursue, and can explain that reasoning clearly to lawyers and non-lawyers alike&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work collaboratively with legal colleagues, outside counsel, and business partners, and are motivated by the work itself&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
