&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience navigating multi-stakeholder agreements involving technical and policy considerations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity about AI technology and AI policy, and a commitment to responsible AI development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach to working with colleagues and external partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &quot;doer&quot; attitude—willingness to roll up your sleeves and pitch in where needed-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
