&lt;p&gt;Directly manage and develop a team of 4-8 Customer Success Managers supporting strategic nonprofit accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a player-coach by directly owning a few strategic accounts, driving outcomes for our highest-impact partnerships while demonstrating best-in-class customer success practices for the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape and execute account strategies that nurture growth and deepen impact within nonprofit and mission-driven organizations, adapting enterprise CS motions to the realities of nonprofit budgets, capacity, and stakeholder structures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support future nonprofit launches. As our products and offerings evolve, partner with Product, Marketing, Partnerships, and Sales to determine how we bring them to customers, and hold the team accountable for partners realizing the value the launch promised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
