&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a visible voice on AI adoption in the nonprofit and mission-driven sector, represent Anthropic at sector convenings, customer-facing forums, and bring that external point of view back to sharpen our strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
