&lt;li&gt;Owned a high-traffic marketing or brand web surface end to end: CMS, frontend, infrastructure, and the publishing workflow around it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong frontend depth yourself, TypeScript, React, modern CSS, a modern headless CMS, and a real preference for staying close to the code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built tooling that made non-engineers faster and safer, with a concrete story of what changed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped under real launch pressure with cross-functional partners, without dropping the quality bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating at the seam between Design, Marketing, and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep interest in AI and excitement about putting Claude into the build and publish loop itself, not just on the page&lt;/li&gt;
