&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:105;2442-2546&quot;&gt;Strong project management ability with experience influencing cross-functional operational initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:135;2547-2681&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience creating AI workflows with Claude or similar tools, and comfort running and improving them at operational volume&lt;/li&gt;
