&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:90;2776-2865&quot;&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to derive actionable insights from complex datasets&lt;/li&gt;
