&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define product strategy for experimental initiatives that push beyond our current offerings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creatively build MVPs and prototypes to validate product-market fit with the lowest cost possible&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead vision, strategy, roadmap, and execution of frontier technologies that leverage the latest AI capabilities to solve real-world problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and run the programs through which beneficial organizations across all pillars get access to Claude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the path from access to success. Find out what stops these organizations from deploying Claude and remove it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
