&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of products or programs that reached a large number of users or organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can navigate and execute amidst ambiguity, flex into new domains based on the problem at hand, and find simple solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think creatively about the risks and benefits of new technologies, beyond existing checklists and playbooks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay hands-on with emerging research and prototype with AI tools like Claude Code&lt;/p&gt;
