&lt;li&gt;Own the multi-cloud strategy and roadmap for our safeguards — data retention, automated review, human review, and enforcement — designed to fit each partner&#39;s operating model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design product experiences and operations paths for managing eligibility criteria, verification paths, and the controls attached to differentiated capabilities for higher-trust organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build threat-intelligence sharing with AWS, Google, and Microsoft so misuse is detected and acted on consistently across surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive our transparency commitments to customers and partners on data access, review, and enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fraud &amp;amp; Abuse&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
