&lt;p&gt;Work cross-functionally with technical, product, policy, and business teams to collect information efficiently, evaluate risk, and develop resolution strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Anthropic in interactions with regulators and enforcement staff, and support public policy colleagues in broader regulator engagement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop internal processes, playbooks, and tools that make regulatory response scalable and consistent across matters, including where inquiries may overlap with each other or litigation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track enforcement trends and regulatory developments and share them with stakeholders in a form they can act on&lt;/p&gt;
