&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Adapt quickly to changing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Maintain clarity when debugging complex, time-sensitive issues&lt;/li&gt;
