&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is looking for a Senior Partner Account Manager (PAM) to own our relationship with one to two of the world&#39;s largest global systems integrators. This is a general-management role disguised as an alliance role: you will set the multi-year joint strategy with the partner&#39;s C-suite, negotiate the strategic agreement that underpins it, and then build the machine — go-to-market, solution co-development, delivery readiness, and enablement at a scale of tens of thousands of practitioners — that turns Claude into one of the partner&#39;s largest and fastest-growing practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be measured on the size and health of the joint business: progress against a $1B+ Claude practice plan, Anthropic ARR sourced and influenced through the partner, certified and delivery-ready practitioners (50,000+), co-developed solutions in market with reference-able customers, and the depth of executive alignment on both sides.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the joint business.&lt;/strong&gt; Build and run a multi-year joint business plan with each GSI covering services bookings, Anthropic ARR, priority industries and geographies, investment, and headcount. Report on it to Anthropic and partner executive leadership quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead at the C-suite.&lt;/strong&gt; Be the primary Anthropic relationship owner for the partner&#39;s Group CEO, service-line and industry CEOs, CTO/Chief AI Officer, and Chief Learning Officer. Map and activate Anthropic executive sponsors, run CEO-level QBRs, and shape the partner&#39;s public AI narrative (earnings calls, analyst days, flagship events) around Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiate the strategic agreement.&lt;/strong&gt; Structure and close multi-year strategic collaboration agreements spanning consumption and resale commitments, co-investment and market development funds, co-marketing, IP and solution terms, and enterprise-wide internal deployment of Claude across the partner&#39;s own workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-develop solutions.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Anthropic Product, Applied AI, and the GSI&#39;s CTO office to co-build industry and horizontal offerings, agentic and Claude Code delivery accelerators, and reference architectures; take them to market with named launch customers and published references.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a 50,000+ practitioner practice.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and land a certification and delivery-readiness system inside the partner — embedded in their academy/L&amp;amp;D, train-the-trainer led, tied to Claude Partner Network tier requirements — and hold the partner accountable to capability they build themselves rather than capacity Anthropic supplies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive global co-sell.&lt;/strong&gt; Stand up joint account planning and pursuit governance with Anthropic field leadership across NA, EMEA, and APAC; personally engage on the largest strategic pursuits; ensure clean attribution through deal registration and CRM discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run alliance governance.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and chair a joint steering committee with named workstreams (GTM, solutions, delivery readiness, enablement, marketing), clear owners on both sides, and a published operating cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through others.&lt;/strong&gt; Orchestrate a global virtual team of partner solutions architects, partner marketing, enablement, regional PAMs, and sales leaders; mentor PAMs across the team; scope and make the case for dedicated resourcing as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the program.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring the voice of the largest GSIs into Anthropic&#39;s partner strategy, Elite-tier program design, and product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in alliances, partner sales, or consulting leadership, including 8+ years owning a top-tier GSI relationship (e.g., IBM, NTT Data, Capgemini) at a hyperscaler or category-defining enterprise software/AI company — or the mirror-image role leading a hyperscaler/AI alliance from inside a GSI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of personally building or scaling a partner practice to $500M–$1B+ and tens of thousands of trained practitioners, with the joint business plan, governance, and metrics to show for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated C-suite presence: you have set agendas with GSI Group CEOs and service-line leaders, and you can hold a strategy conversation and a commercial negotiation in the same meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating and closing multi-year strategic collaboration agreements with nine-figure commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in GSI economics — utilization, pyramid, offering margin, industry P&amp;amp;Ls, delivery-center models — and how a new technology practice actually gets funded and staffed inside one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strongly commercial orientation: you are a business driver first and a relationship manager second, and you are comfortable pushing a partner to invest in its own capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global operating experience across NA, EMEA, and APAC, including time with India-based delivery leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego, high curiosity, and a habit of making the people around you better; you put the mission ahead of personal credit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
