&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, build, and maintain the distributed systems that serve Claude to millions of users worldwide&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop resilient, flexible systems that adapt in real time to real world events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop intelligent request routing, load balancing, and traffic management systems across thousands of accelerators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
