&lt;li&gt;Own large-scale infrastructure systems and lead ambiguous, cross-team technical projects from design through production and can do so independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with cloud infrastructure (GCP, AWS, or Azure) at scale and/or Enterprise SaaS experience in a multi-tenant context, with background in security, compliance or data residency for regulated or sovereign cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
