&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating data pipelines or data stores in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across the data stack, including ingestion, storage, and consumption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to explain technical tradeoffs to people outside your discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
