&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with AAI AMER leadership to build and evolve foundational metrics dashboards, and establish the operating rhythm for ongoing business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the monthly business review process for your assigned segment(s) — from metric gathering through analysis and synthesis for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with central Revenue Operations to define and standardize key metrics across segments as the business grows in complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a use case framework grounded in real signal — current CRM data, joining sales calls and pitch clinics, reviewing key customers, and working directly with the AAI team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build comprehensive segment analyses and strategy recommendations, identifying quick wins and prioritization frameworks, and help kick off the strategic initiatives that follow from approved recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with regional leaders and act as a trusted, embedded thought partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support GTM QBRs and related cross-functional workstreams as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement improved processes for tracking and reporting on team priorities and strategic initiatives, and represent that work to stakeholders across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
