&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capabilities with a track record of converting data into actionable, well-supported recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GTM systems and business intelligence tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build trust and influence senior stakeholders without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and managing strategic planning processes and business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, economics, or a related quantitative field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
