&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: [San Francisco / hybrid, or remote US near the regional portfolio?]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: [up to 40%] to construction sites in the regional portfolio and to supplier factories as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
