&lt;li&gt;Have worked in or close to a Salesforce-centric GTM or RevOps systems org and understand how lead, opportunity, partner, and quote objects connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have managed delivery where multiple teams ship into one core system on a shared release process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have partnered with audit, controls, or compliance functions on revenue-impacting systems work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can build trust with business systems analysts, developers, sales operations, and finance, and translate between them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable driving outcomes across teams that don&#39;t report to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are genuinely curious about how AI changes GTM operations and willing to experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
